## 8. Code Blocks

### Python

```python
def greet(name):
    print(f"Hello, {name}!")
    return True

greet("World")
```

### JavaScript

```javascript
const greet = (name) => {
    console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);
};

greet("World");
```

### Bash

```bash
pip install markup-plus
mup examples/fulltest.mup
```

### No Language

```
Just plain text code block.
No highlighting.
```

