Then a quote:

> Code is poetry.

And finally a **bold closing statement**.

---

## 10. Edge Cases

Text with multiple `code spans` in one line.

Text with multiple **bold words**.

Special characters: < > & " '

Numbers: 1 2 3 42 1000

---

## Summary

All features work:

- Headings (H1-H6)
- Bold, Italic, Inline code
- Paragraphs
- Unordered lists
- Ordered lists
- Blockquotes
- Horizontal rules
- Code blocks (with/without language)
